msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Taiga「There's Kitamura-kun! Look, sitting by＿the window in Sudoh-Bucks.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ahí está Kitamura-kun! Mira, sentado＿junto a la ventana en Sudoh-Bucks.」"

msgid "Ami「Whoa, Yuusaku looks so depressed＿and gloomy!!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡¡Uau, Yuusaku se ve tan＿deprimido y sombrío!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, it's unmistakably gloomy, even at＿a distance......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, se nota sombrío sin lugar a dudas,＿incluso a lo lejos......」"

msgid "Taiga「Kitamura-kun looks like the spirit's＿been drained right out of him...... Poor＿guy.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Parece que a Kitamura-kun le hubieran＿absorbido el alma...... Pobre.」"

msgid "Ami「Well, it's all up to Takasu-kun now♪」"
msgstr "Ami「Bueno, ahora todo depende de Takasu-kun♪」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? Aren't you going, Kawashima?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? ¿Tú no vas, Kawashima?」"

msgid "Ami「Are you joking? It'd be SUPER weird＿for Ami-chan to invite him. And Tiger＿can't do it either.」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Bromeas? Sería SÚPER raro que＿Ami-chan lo invitara. Y Tigre＿tampoco puede hacerlo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Fine, guess I have to.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bien, supongo que tendré que ir yo.」"

msgid "Ami「Please and thanks.」"
msgstr "Ami「Por favor y gracias.」"

msgid "Taiga「Look at Kitamura-kun's listless＿expression. Ryuuji, don't dawdle. Get in＿there and do something!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Mira la cara de desgano de Kitamura-kun.＿Ryuuji, no pierdas el tiempo. ¡Entra＿y haz algo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What a pair of slave drivers......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Vaya par de explotadoras......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kitamura!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Kitamura!」"

msgid "Kitamura「............」"
msgstr "Kitamura「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「KI・TA・MU・RA!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¡KI・TA・MU・RA!!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Huh......? Oh, Takasu......!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Eh......? ¡Oh, Takasu......!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh...... Morvening. How've you been,＿Kitamura?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah...... Buenos díanoches. ¿Cómo＿has estado, Kitamura?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Ha ha ha! I just saw you yesterday,＿didn't I? I'm just dandy!! Need proof?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡Ja, ja, ja! Si te vi ayer mismo,＿¿no? ¡¡Estoy de maravilla!!＿¿Quieres pruebas?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Keep your clothes on. As long as＿you're okay, I'm happy. Are you free＿tomorrow? I'd like to see you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No te quites la ropa. Con tal de＿que estés bien, me alegro. ¿Estás＿libre mañana? Quisiera verte.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Why so formal?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Por qué tanta formalidad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Have you heard of Luxure's＿planetarium?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Has oído hablar del planetario＿de Luxure?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Isn't Luxure the number one hottest＿date spot right now......?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿No es Luxure el lugar de citas número＿uno más popular ahora mismo......?」"

msgid "Kitamura「*Gasp* Are you asking me out? Stop＿right there, Takasu. I'm not mentally＿prepared for this.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡Ah! ¿Me estás invitando a salir?＿Detente ahí, Takasu. No estoy preparado＿mentalmente para esto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Dumbass! I'm only inviting you because＿I thought you might be lonely. Nothing＿more.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Idiota! Solo te invito porque pensé que＿podrías sentirte solo. Nada más.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Planetarium......? Space...... Frontier......＿America......?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Planetario......? ¿Espacio......＿Frontera...... Estados Unidos......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No no! Just because it's about space＿doesn't mean it has anything to do with＿Kanou Sumire in the slightest!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No, no! ¡Que sea sobre el espacio＿no significa que tenga algo que ver＿con Kanou Sumire ni por asomo!」"

msgid "Kitamura「......Takasu, why are you doing this?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......Takasu, ¿por qué haces esto?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「*Gasp*!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¡Ah!!」"

msgid "Kitamura「How do you know about space's＿relation to the Prez if you have＿amnesia? Did Ami and Aisaka tell you?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Cómo sabes la relación del espacio＿con la presidenta si tienes amnesia?＿¿Te lo contaron Ami y Aisaka?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I haven't been told anything. Nothing＿at all. It was just a figure of speech.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「N-No me han dicho nada. Nada de nada.＿Solo era una forma de hablar.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Your eyes are all over the place,＿Takasu. Look straight into my eyes.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Tienes la mirada por todos lados,＿Takasu. Mírame directo a los ojos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（For Kitamura's sake, I can't screw up＿here......!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Por el bien de Kitamura, no puedo＿arruinarlo aquí......!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「K-Kitamura! Likewise, YOU look into＿MY eyes!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡K-Kitamura! ¡TÚ también＿mírame a MIS ojos!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Mm...... When I look right into them,＿they're so piercing......」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Mm...... Cuando los miro directamente,＿son tan penetrantes......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Listen, I...... want......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Escucha, yo...... quiero......」"

msgid "Kitamura「......?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I! WANT! TO GO TO THE COUPLES'＿PLANETARIUM WITH YOUUU!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡YO! ¡QUIERO! ¡¡IR AL PLANETARIO＿PARA PAREJAS CONTIGOOO!!」"

msgid "Kitamura「............」"
msgstr "Kitamura「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Huh? Did I just......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Eh? ¿Acabo de......?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Takasu, I've always thought you were a＿manly guy, but to this extent......」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Takasu, siempre pensé que eras muy＿hombre, pero llegar a este punto......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hold on, Kitamura.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Espera, Kitamura.」"

msgid "Kitamura「When you put it like that, no＿self-respecting man could run away.＿Let's go to Luxure tomorrow.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Si lo dices así, ningún hombre＿que se respete podría huir.＿Vamos mañana a Luxure.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Okay! Yes please.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡E-Está bien! Sí, por favor.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Goodbye, Takasu. See you tomorrow.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Adiós, Takasu. Nos vemos mañana.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, see ya.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, nos vemos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Did it...... go well? It must have......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Salió...... bien? Seguro que sí......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（*Sigh*...... Just when I try to catch a＿break, I get this itching feeling......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（*Suspiro*...... Justo cuando＿intento relajarme un poco, me＿entra esta comezón......）」"

msgid "I need to go to the bathroom"
msgstr "Tengo que ir al baño"

msgid "I need to clean something"
msgstr "Tengo que limpiar algo"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......I need to go to the bathroom...... Be＿right back......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Tengo que ir al baño......＿Vuelvo enseguida......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Now I really wanna clean something......＿It's fine if I do it on the down-low so I＿won't bother anyone......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（De verdad quiero limpiar algo......＿No pasa nada si lo hago en secreto para＿no molestar a nadie......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Oho......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Oho......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（A sports magazine. Someone must've＿left it here after they were done＿reading it.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Una revista deportiva. Alguien＿la habrá dejado aquí después＿de terminar de leerla.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Magazines can be turned into cleaning＿tools. Throwing it away is MOTTAINAI!＿Pick it up!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Las revistas sirven para limpiar.＿¿Tirarla? ¡QUÉ DESPERDICIO! ¡Recógela!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Couldn't find anything......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No pude encontrar nada......）」"

msgid "Kitamura「Y-Yo, good morning! No, it's not really＿morning anymore, is it? Is it too early＿to say \"good evening\"?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡H-Hola, buenos días! No, ya no es＿de mañana, ¿verdad? ¿Es muy temprano＿para decir \"buenas noches\"?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Repeat after me: \"Morvening!!\"」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Repite conmigo: \"¡¡Buenos díanoches!!\"」"

msgid "Kitamura「I thought something was strange when＿you invited me to the planetarium in＿the first place.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Ya me parecía raro desde el principio＿que me invitaras al planetario.」"

msgid "Kitamura「It's not somewhere two guys would go.＿What are you thinking?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「No es un lugar al que irían dos＿chicos. ¿Qué estás pensando?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't look at me so suspiciously. I'm＿inviting you with no ill intent. I mean,＿aren't you curious?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No me mires con tanta sospecha.＿Te invito sin malas intenciones.＿Digo, ¿no te da curiosidad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You know, the foam seats, the soothing＿aroma...... what was after that?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya sabes, los asientos de espuma, el＿aroma relajante...... ¿qué seguía?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Just as I expected of Sudoh-Bucks! It's＿nice and clean, just as a restaurant＿should be. There wasn't much to clean）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Como esperaba de Sudoh-Bucks! Está＿limpio, como debe estar un restaurante.＿No había mucho que limpiar）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（here.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（aquí.）」"
